            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Rio Tinto to acquire Arcadium Lithium in $6.7B cash deal",
            "description": "<p>Mining giant Rio Tinto (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RIO\">RIO</a>) will officially purchase Arcadium Lithium (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ALTM\">ALTM</a>) in a $6.7 billion cash acquisition, priced at $5.85 per Arcadium share. This deal is set to catapult Rio Tinto as one of the leaders in lithium production.</p>\n<p>Catalysts Co-Hosts <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/seana-smith/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Seana Smith</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/madison-mills/\">Madison Mills </a>break down the details.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Catalysts\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/catalysts/\">here</a>.</p>\n<p><em>This post was written by </em><a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/angel-smith/\"><em>Angel Smith</em></a></p>",
